  "bodyHash": "1ca46b7fb8983500",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>掠夺者曾是袭击中的炮灰，也是玩家的经验来源。如今，崛起的时刻已到。掏出霰弹枪，痛扁他们吧！</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模组将掠夺者的弩替换为三种枪械。此外，他们不会再互相伤害。这些枪械不会由掠夺者掉落，也无法合成，因此不会影响其他枪械模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">自 3.0.0 版本起，本模组全面支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ</a>，允许实体使用 TACZ 的枪械。（需安装 TACZ 1.1.6）</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px\">自 1.3.0 版本起，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villagers</a> 将使用本模组的枪械，而</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a> 自 2.0.0 版本起也将获得良好支持。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px\">自 2.3.0 版本起，本模组可与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ</a> 及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sbw</a> 兼容。</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#e67e23\">该功能灵感来源于 <strong>zeroaresiv</strong> 创作的 <a style=\"color:#e67e23\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pillager's Gun: TaCz</a>。感谢其在此创意上的出色工作。若想在 2.3.0 版本前体验此功能，请使用对应的资源包。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">手枪是基础枪械，弹容量为 8 发，伤害是弩的两倍。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">突击步枪具备三连发点射模式，使掠夺者能更轻松地命中敌人。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">霰弹枪装填 7 发子弹，拥有更高的伤害，并有概率击碎盾牌。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;狙击步枪具备极高的护甲穿透力和超远射程——它是每位玩家的噩梦。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">火箭筒是掠夺者的终极武器——其强大的火力可摧毁任何防线。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">本模组可放入整合包中使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#f90;font-size:24px\">搭配 <a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-survival-kit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zombie Survival Kit</a>，掠夺者将与怪物并肩作战！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#f90;font-size:24px\">建议与本模组的衍生扩展 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chaoszproject-bandits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChaosZProject: Bandits! - Pillager's Gun Addon</a> 搭配使用。</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#f90;font-size:24px\">手持枪械的匪徒将成为真正的生存威胁——尤其在末日场景中！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/39/qq20231209234713.png\" alt=\"掠夺者的枪械\" width=\"850\" height=\"474\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/40/qq20231209234332.png\" alt=\"袭击\" width=\"845\" height=\"472\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/41/qq20231209234607.png\" alt=\"与铁傀儡战斗\" width=\"852\" height=\"478\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>贡献者</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>白久谷</strong> - 美术与模型</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Scarasol</strong> - 程序开发</span></p>",
